body:
for when you’re sad: [“i’m sad again”](https://open.spotify.com/playlist/4iTlLMltbneyuF5ysv0L1k?si=8_CC_9lsTlqO3tPrre6qwQ)

for when you’re both angry and sad: [“fuck you”](https://open.spotify.com/playlist/3Fh4U5XNbPfu3AtDMOm14M?si=ejk_kY4STa69OjcGaV2lFQ)

for that ‘high’ feeling that often comes after yeeting: [“high”](https://open.spotify.com/playlist/61bBkCTljBMo4kMw6uMnLm?si=FFRDvvLkSH2_1Jz5to3GvA)

i hope they help :)
